{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_69_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_69","textTraditional":"一、六年，春王正月。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_69_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_69","textTraditional":"二、夏，公會齊侯、宋公、陳侯、衞侯、曹伯伐鄭，圍新城。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_69_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_69","textTraditional":"邑不言圍，此其言圍何？彊也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_69_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_69","textTraditional":"三、秋，楚人圍許，諸侯遂救許。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_69_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_69","textTraditional":"四、冬，公至自伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":5}],"overrides":{}}